  "metadata": {
    "title": "Lagoon Pingo atmospheric drone measurements and validation data",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19597182",
    "publication_date": "2026-06-28",
    "description": "<p>Data intended for quantifying methane emissions from Lagoon Pingo, an open system pingo, was collected during a field campaign in Moskus Lagoon, Adventdalen, Svalbard. Methane emissions was inferred from drone-based atmospheric measurements using Bayesian inference. These estimates were compared to 1) dissolved methane measurements measuring the methane concentration in the water bodies where the methane was emitted, 2) floating flux chamber measurements that gives an estimate of the methane surface flux and ebullition measurments giving percentage concentration of the observed bubbles coming from the lake at the site.</p>\n<p>This dataset includes:</p>\n<p>1) Drone-based atmospheric measurements -- in the form of processed data from individual sensors and processed, synchronised and merged data from all the sensors (including the flight log).&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Processed data from individual sensors:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aeris Mira Strato closed-path methane gas analyser (measured methane dry mole fraction) : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/svalbard_aeris_all_flights.nc/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">svalbard_aeris_all_flights.nc</a></li>\n<li>Li-Cor Trisonica Sphere ultrasonic anemometer (measured 3D wind speed components) : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/svalbard_trisonica_corrected_split_flights.nc/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">svalbard_trisonica_corrected_split_flights.nc</a></li>\n<li>DJI M300 RTK flight log : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/svalbard_flightrecords.nc/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">svalbard_flightrecords.nc</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Processed, merged and synchronised data : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/svalbard_merged.nc/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">svalbard_merged.nc</a></p>\n<p>The processing code repository : https://github.com/johanage/lagoon-pingo-analysis.git&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2) Dissolved methane concentration measurements measured from water samples, and ebullition methane percentage measurements in the form of an excel file : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/Dissolved_methane_floating_flux_chamber_ebullition.xlsx/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dissolved_methane_floating_flux_chamber_ebullition.xlsx</a></p>\n<p>3) Multispectral aerial images of the field site taken with the AgEagle Micasense Altum PT in the form of .tif files, date is indicated in filenames.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Surface temperature : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/2024.08.26_ThermalAgisoft_5cm.tif/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2024.08.26_ThermalAgisoft_5cm.tif</a></li>\n<li>NDVI : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/2024.08.26_Pix4D_ndvi.tif/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2024.08.26_Pix4D_ndvi.tif</a></li>\n<li>DSM : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/2024.08.26_DSM_5cm.tif/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2024.08.26_DSM_5cm.tif</a></li>\n<li>RGB : <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/2024.08.26_Pix4D_BGR.tif/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2024.08.26_Pix4D_BGR.tif</a>, <a class=\"text-break\" href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/19597182/draft/files/2024.08.26_Pix4D_OrthoColour_5cm.tif/content\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2024.08.26_Pix4D_OrthoColour_5cm.tif</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
